# PROD/DEV docker LXCs (10.15.20.x, 10.15.25.x) authenticate root@ with the
# "DZsec Roots" 1P key. Pin it so the agent offers ONLY that key — without
# IdentitiesOnly the agent cycles other keys and burns MaxAuthTries (the
# crosscut/bigsky root@ symptom). Same pattern as dzsec-bench.
# Matches when connecting by IP (ssh root@10.15.20.10); add aliases if you use them.
Match user root host 10.15.20.*,10.15.25.*
    IdentitiesOnly yes
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/dzsec_roots.pub
